msgid ""
"This test checks for configured Nameservers.\n"
"If you get a \"unconfirmed\" message:\n"
"- please check your DHCP, cabling and Adapter setup\n"
"- if you configured your Nameservers manually please verify your entries in "
"the \"Nameserver\" Configuration"
msgstr ""
"Šis testas tikrina sukonfigūruotus DNS serverius.\n"
"Jei gauni pranešimą „nepatvirtinta“:\n"
"- patikrink DHCP, laidus ir adapterio nustatymus\n"
"- jei DNS serverius konfigūravai rankiniu būdu, patikrink įrašus „DNS "
"serverio“ konfigūracijoje"

msgid ""
"This test checks whether a network cable is connected to your LAN-Adapter.\n"
"If you get a \"disconnected\" message:\n"
"- verify that a network cable is attached\n"
"- verify that the cable is not broken"
msgstr ""
"Šis testas tikrina, ar tinklo kabelis prijungtas prie LAN adapterio.\n"
"Jei gauni pranešimą „atjungta“:\n"
"- patikrink, ar prijungtas tinklo kabelis\n"
"- patikrink, ar kabelis nepažeistas"

msgid ""
"This test checks whether a valid IP Address is found for your LAN Adapter.\n"
"If you get a \"unconfirmed\" message:\n"
"- no valid IP Address was found\n"
"- please check your DHCP, cabling and adapter setup"
msgstr ""
"Šis testas tikrina, ar LAN adapteriui rastas tinkamas IP adresas.\n"
"Jei gauni pranešimą „nepatvirtinta“:\n"
"- tinkamas IP adresas nerastas\n"
"- patikrink DHCP, laidus ir adapterio nustatymus"

msgid ""
"This test checks whether your LAN Adapter is set up for automatic IP Address "
"configuration with DHCP.\n"
"If you get a \"disabled\" message:\n"
" - then your LAN Adapter is configured for manual IP Setup\n"
"- verify thay you have entered correct IP informations in the AdapterSetup "
"dialog.\n"
"If you get an \"enabeld\" message:\n"
"-verify that you have a configured and working DHCP Server in your network."
msgstr ""
"Šis testas tikrina, ar LAN adapteris nustatytas automatiniam IP adreso "
"konfigūravimui per DHCP.\n"
"Jei gauni pranešimą „išjungta“:\n"
"- tada LAN adapteris sukonfigūruotas rankiniam IP nustatymui\n"
"- patikrink, ar adapterio nustatymų dialoge įvedei teisingą IP informaciją.\n"
"Jei gauni pranešimą „įjungta“:\n"
"- patikrink, ar tinkle yra sukonfigūruotas ir veikiantis DHCP serveris."

msgid "This test detects your configured LAN-Adapter."
msgstr "Šis testas aptinka sukonfigūruotą LAN adapterį."

